<title>FRANCE: TEMPLETON HAS 5.4 PERCENT OF RENAULT.</title>
<headline>TEMPLETON HAS 5.4 PERCENT OF RENAULT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Templeton Global Investors has lifted its participation in French carmaker Renault to 5.4 percent of the capital and voting rights, French financial markets regulator CMF said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The stake represents 12,955,079 shares held in investment funds or client accounts under management, CMF said.</p>
